#: ../../library/math.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`math` --- mathematical functions"
msgstr ":mod:`math` --- fonctions mathématiques"

#: ../../library/math.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``math`` module provides some basic mathematical functions for working "
"with floating-point numbers."
msgstr ""
"Le module ``math`` fournit quelques fonctions mathématiques de base pour "
"travailler avec les nombres à virgule flottante."

#: ../../library/math.rst:10
msgid ""
"*Note:* On the OpenMV Cam, floating-point numbers have 32-bit precision."
msgstr ""
"*Note :* Sur l'OpenMV Cam, les nombres à virgule flottante ont une précision"
" de 32 bits."

#: ../../library/math.rst:13
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../library/math.rst:17
msgid "Return the inverse cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'arc cosinus de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:21
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'arc cosinus hyperbolique de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:25
msgid "Return the inverse sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'arc sinus de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:29
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'arc sinus hyperbolique de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:33
msgid "Return the inverse tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'arc tangente de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:37
msgid "Return the principal value of the inverse tangent of ``y/x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la valeur principale de l'arc tangente de ``y/x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:41
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'arc tangente hyperbolique de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:45
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards positive infinity."
msgstr "Renvoie un entier, soit ``x`` arrondi vers l'infini positif."

#: ../../library/math.rst:49
msgid "Return ``x`` with the sign of ``y``."
msgstr "Renvoie ``x`` avec le signe de ``y``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:53
msgid "Return the cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie le cosinus de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:57
msgid "Return the hyperbolic cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie le cosinus hyperbolique de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:61
msgid "Return radians ``x`` converted to degrees."
msgstr "Renvoie les radians ``x`` convertis en degrés."

#: ../../library/math.rst:65
msgid "Return the error function of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la fonction d'erreur de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:69
msgid "Return the complementary error function of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la fonction d'erreur complémentaire de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:73
msgid "Return the exponential of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'exponentielle de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:77
msgid "Return ``exp(x) - 1``."
msgstr "Renvoie ``exp(x) - 1``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:81
msgid "Return the absolute value of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la valeur absolue de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:85
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards negative infinity."
msgstr "Renvoie un entier, soit ``x`` arrondi vers l'infini négatif."

#: ../../library/math.rst:89
msgid "Return the remainder of ``x/y``."
msgstr "Renvoie le reste de ``x/y``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:93
msgid ""
"Decomposes a floating-point number into its mantissa and exponent. The "
"returned value is the tuple ``(m, e)`` such that ``x == m * 2**e`` exactly."
"  If ``x == 0`` then the function returns ``(0.0, 0)``, otherwise the "
"relation ``0.5 <= abs(m) < 1`` holds."
msgstr ""
"Décompose un nombre à virgule flottante en sa mantisse et son exposant. La "
"valeur renvoyée est le tuple ``(m, e)`` tel que ``x == m * 2**e`` "
"exactement. Si ``x == 0`` alors la fonction renvoie ``(0.0, 0)``, sinon la "
"relation ``0.5 <= abs(m) < 1`` est vérifiée."

#: ../../library/math.rst:100
msgid "Return the gamma function of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la fonction gamma de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:104
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is finite."
msgstr "Renvoie ``True`` si ``x`` est fini."

#: ../../library/math.rst:108
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is infinite."
msgstr "Renvoie ``True`` si ``x`` est infini."

#: ../../library/math.rst:112
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is not-a-number"
msgstr "Renvoie ``True`` si ``x`` n'est pas un nombre"

#: ../../library/math.rst:116
msgid "Return ``x * (2**exp)``."
msgstr "Renvoie ``x * (2**exp)``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:120
msgid "Return the natural logarithm of the gamma function of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie le logarithme naturel de la fonction gamma de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:124
msgid "With one argument, return the natural logarithm of *x*."
msgstr "Avec un seul argument, renvoie le logarithme naturel de *x*."

#: ../../library/math.rst:126
msgid "With two arguments, return the logarithm of *x* to the given *base*."
msgstr ""
"Avec deux arguments, renvoie le logarithme de *x* dans la *base* donnée."

#: ../../library/math.rst:130
msgid "Return the base-10 logarithm of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie le logarithme en base 10 de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:134
msgid "Return the base-2 logarithm of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie le logarithme en base 2 de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:138
msgid ""
"Return a tuple of two floats, being the fractional and integral parts of "
"``x``.  Both return values have the same sign as ``x``."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie un tuple de deux flottants, soit les parties fractionnaire et "
"entière de ``x``. Les deux valeurs renvoyées ont le même signe que ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:143
msgid "Returns ``x`` to the power of ``y``."
msgstr "Renvoie ``x`` élevé à la puissance ``y``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:147
msgid "Return degrees ``x`` converted to radians."
msgstr "Renvoie les degrés ``x`` convertis en radians."

#: ../../library/math.rst:151
msgid "Return the sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie le sinus de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:155
msgid "Return the hyperbolic sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie le sinus hyperbolique de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:159
msgid "Return the square root of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la racine carrée de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:163
msgid "Return the tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la tangente de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:167
msgid "Return the hyperbolic tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Renvoie la tangente hyperbolique de ``x``."

#: ../../library/math.rst:171
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards 0."
msgstr "Renvoie un entier, soit ``x`` arrondi vers 0."

#: ../../library/math.rst:174
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Constantes"

#: ../../library/math.rst:179
msgid "Base of the natural logarithm."
msgstr "Base du logarithme naturel."

